OL,3,GNEWSAM11 partially closed after
OL,4,Amulti-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe M11 has been partially closed in
OL,7,Fboth directions following a crash
OL,8,Finvolving a number of vehicles, police
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FIt happened at about 11:10 GMT on the
OL,12,Fsouthbound carriageway near Girton,
OL,13,FCambridgeshire, with a second minor
OL,14,Fcollision taking place shortly
OL,15,Fafterwards on the opposite carriageway.
OL,17,FEmergency services including an air
OL,18,Fambulance were at the scene.
OL,20,FCambridgeshire Police said details of
OL,21,Fany injuries were "unclear at this
OL,22,Fstage".
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
